TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-math-0603217v3
AU  - MURAKAMI, HITOSHI
TI  - A version of the volume conjecture
DA  - D:20181122
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/math/0603217
AB  - We propose a version of the volume conjecture that would relate a certain limit of the colored Jones polynomials of a knot to the volume function deﬁned by a representation of the fundamental group of the knot complement to the special linear group of degree two over complex numbers. We also conﬁrm the conjecture for the ﬁgure-eight knot and torus knots. This version is diﬀerent from S. Gukov’s because of a choice of polarization.
ER  - 
